  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Malawi - Revenue Policy and Administration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance to the Malawi Revenue Authority focuses on enhancing basic audit capabilities in the Large Taxpayer Office (LTO); building capacity in the LTO to audit large taxpayers in specialized industries (i.e. telecommunications and financial services); customs risk management and enforcement; investigation of corruption, criminal tax and customs cases.</narrative>
  </description>
